tion air line reports the true air and names the skin, its ⚠ reads the true share, and MCP `toolpath_summaries` carry `air_cut_removing_share`; the air figures, the gates and the thresholds do not change. Sentries: `a_helical_waterline_cuts_a_stack_with_one_entry_d69`, `an_old_waterline_loads_helical_w1b`, `a_waterline_widens_its_step_on_a_vertical_wall_w2`, `a_rest_waterline_after_a_rough_widens_its_wall_step_w2`, `a_waterline_stops_at_the_web_of_a_through_cut_w4`, lib `the_wall_step_reads_the_deflection_model_w2`, `air_that_removes_material_is_a_skin_g_wlairlabel`, `the_air_line_reads_the_true_air_share_g_wlairlabel` |
